Cell["\<\
Checks every consecutive three-layer window for coupling between its first \
and third layers and prints diagnostics. A failed check prints a request to \
reduce the division number and returns no block result.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1692484479,ExpressionUUID->"95ec65af-27fc-9f43-bf8d-37ad73af6992"]
}, Closed]],

